This product includes software developed for the WUCI-JI project.

This package contains a new Orange translation and interpreter bridge for
Daylight Horizon v17's cryptographic mechanics. It follows the Apache-2.0
Daylight v17 Horizon and v15 Meridian sources at upstream revision
fec91dc6618d477908790520118bae7e25909c43.

The new/modified material is daylight.or, daylight-horizon.or, daylight.py,
emit_example.py, test_daylight.py, README.md and validation.txt. The work was
AI-assisted with OpenAI Codex. No Noether Forge initramfs patches are included.
